# HuntTrackPipe - Current State (2026-10-31)

## Done: all 5 steps + post-step dropdown/lock work
- **Step 1 (core + CLI)**: config, naming, session store, Jev client/questions/derive, schema builder, Claude client, post-processing, Excel writer (`backend/excel/tracker.py`), `backend/pipeline.py` (`extract()`, `create_application(..., allow_duplicate=)`), CLI `python -m backend.run` (`--allow-duplicate`, exit 5 on duplicate). Column lists / shipped dropdown defaults / `meta_payload()` live in `backend/columns.py`.
- **Step 2 (webapp)**: FastAPI `backend/main.py` + `backend/api/` on :8010; Vue 3 / Vite 7 / Pinia / Tailwind v4 in `frontend/` on :5180 (`strictPort`, `/api` proxy). Root `npm run dev` runs both. Screens: `DashboardView`, `NewApplicationView`, `SessionView` (tabs overview / files / questions / log), `ConvertView`, `SettingsView`.
- **Step 3 (files)**: `backend/files/` (`convert.py`, `combine.py`, `manager.py` = `FileManager`), router `routers/files.py`, UI `components/FilesPanel.vue` + `/convert`. soffice uses persistent profile `%TEMP%/htp_lo_profile`; caches `<folder>/.converted/`, `.thumbs/`. Image outputs are named `{stem}_p{n}.png`.
- **Step 4 (Q&A)**: `backend/qa/answer.py` (`answer_questions(session, cfg, client, ids=, feedback=, organization=, title=)`; one structured call, limit verification, one re-ask, `question.note`), router `routers/qa.py`, UI `components/QaPanel.vue`, `answers.md` rewritten on every change. User has written `JobHunting/candidate_context.txt`.
- **Step 5 (hardening)**:
  - `backend/logs.py`: `setup_logging(cfg, level, console_level)` (idempotent, re-points the file handler when the applications dir changes), `tail()`. Rotating file `Applications/.htp_logs/htp.log`. Loggers `htp.jev|llm|tracker|pipeline|files|qa|api`. API starts it in the FastAPI lifespan; CLI with quiet console. `GET /api/logs?lines=`.
  - `backend/duplicates.py`: `posting_hash()` (whitespace-collapsed, lower-cased sha256[:16]), `find_duplicates(cfg, text, values)` -> `[DuplicateHit(folder, reason)]` by posting hash and Requisition_ID (+Organization); `DuplicateError` -> 409 `{detail, type:"DuplicateError", duplicates}`. `Posting.hash` stored on create. `POST /extract` returns `duplicates`; `POST /sessions` takes `allow_duplicate`. UI: banner in `NewApplicationView` + `confirm()`; `ApiError.isDuplicate/duplicates`.
  - Re-extract: `POST /sessions/{f}/reextract {use_jev, use_llm}` -> `{extraction, row, diff}` (`row_diff()` in `routers/sessions.py` over `EXTRACTED_COLUMNS`, dates normalised to ISO); replaces `session.jev/llm`, writes nothing. UI card in `SessionView` overview: checkbox table of changed columns -> `writeRow(values, force_columns)`.
  - Settings: `PUT /api/settings {config}` deep-merges into the current config, validates with `Settings`, writes `CONFIG_PATH` (paths as posix), `settings.cache_clear()`, re-points logging + retargets lock watch; 400 with field names on validation error. `GET /settings` paths include `config_path`, `log_path`, `tracker_status`. `SettingsView.vue` at `/settings` (form, status, log tail).
  - Tests: `tests/` (pytest offline): `conftest.py` sets `HTP_CONFIG` before importing `backend`, synthetic tracker, fake Jev/Claude. Includes list-DV sync, option add, tracker lock/status. Run `python -m pytest`.
- **After step 5 (agreed):**
  - Dashboard bottom: `DashboardMetrics.vue`. Eleven client-side cards from `GET /api/sessions`: Total / Outcome / Work mode; Country / City / Role category; Subroles / Applied through / Employment type; Status (two columns, includes Applied_Date statistics); Created by month (full width on large screens). Locations/subroles split lists for counting; identified counts exclude `Not set`. No chart library. See DESIGN section 12.3 for counting rules and date calculations.
  - Upload mode default `separate_uploads` when Jev does not state one. Existing `not_stated` sessions left alone.
  - Posting boxes show `cleanPostingText` + Copy all; create/dupe/re-extract use raw paste.
  - Dashboard: no Deadline column; row colors as before; icon-only list Refresh (reload sessions only).
- **Editable dropdowns + Excel DV sync (2026-10-31):**
  - `Settings.options` in config; `EDITABLE_OPTION_COLUMNS` = Application_Status, Applied_Through, Found_From. UI **Add…** via `POST /meta/options/{column}`; `POST /meta/options/sync`; `GET /tracker/status`.
  - `excel/lock_watch.py` (`watchdog` on `~$` file) + probe; `dropdown_sync.py` compare/push; list formula parse strips spaces after commas.
  - UI: header status PNGs in `frontend/src/img/`; `SyncDock.vue` (refresh+Excel logo, blue/yellow/grey, min/max, diffs); Create/Save/Sync greyed when locked.
- Errors: TrackerLocked 423, DuplicateError 409, TrackerError/ValueError/ConversionError 400, FileNotFoundError 404, CandidateContextMissing 412, upload > 50 MB 413, Jev/LLM 502, FileExistsError 409.
- `review.pending_write` is `{values, force_columns}`; set only on 423, flushed by `/row/retry`.

